							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11585#msg11585"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11585#msg11585">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> October 05, 2004, 11:45:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Shockingly enough you don&#039;t really remember the wins in detail. Only time I really remember racing with DA/EiE was when they cried to a GM about us SCing ourselves ahead of them to Xegony. Existan or someone was the GM that handled it. Then we waited for ages for them to clear their way to Xeg island, then to gather for an attempt, and then to lose.<br /><br />Yet looking at the big picture I don&#039;t think DA/EiE complained to GMs much at all, or even to our members. There were quite a few races and some cockblocking (esp during Luclin), but they took it gracefully. Even with some of them having delusions of grandeur, I always thought we were damn lucky to have them as a #2 guild ;) . Things would have been a lot uglier and we&#039;d have acted a lot more draconian against FoT or Forsaken I&#039;d say.<br /><br />Admittedly there were some pretty pointless incidents with DA/EiE that I heard about, but I didn&#039;t really allow those to happen about menial things while I was online.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11589"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
