	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11591"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=542" title="View the profile of Sazzabi">Sazzabi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=542"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:farnum8_349@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11591#msg11591"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11591#msg11591">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #36 on:</b> October 05, 2004, 06:12:16 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11585#msg11585">Quote from: Delheru on October 05, 2004, 11:45:53 am</a></div><div class="quote">Shockingly enough you don&#039;t really remember the wins in detail. Only time I really remember racing with DA/EiE was when they cried to a GM about us SCing ourselves ahead of them to Xegony. Existan or someone was the GM that handled it. Then we waited for ages for them to clear their way to Xeg island, then to gather for an attempt, and then to lose.<br /></div><br />Ascent training mobs all over the zone in and up the ramps for 45 minutes put a slow down on our clearing as we wouldn&#039;t risk moving up with 20 mob trains every other minute. Not sure if that was intended but it sure seemed like it at the time (I later found out how fun it was to see how far up PoA you can make it before dying)<br /><br />We watched you lose to Xegony too that day (some people didn&#039;t camp out like they were supposed to!), though you won second attempt.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: October 05, 2004, 06:23:31 pm by Sazzabi</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11594"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868" title="View the profile of Shrek">Shrek</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 8<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11594#msg11594"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11594#msg11594">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #37 on:</b> October 05, 2004, 09:11:35 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&quot;they cried to a GM about us SCing ourselves ahead of them to Xegony&quot;<br /><br />Heh, I remember that day quite well.&nbsp; The GM was already helping Thufer, think he got stuck under the world.&nbsp; I was afk outside PoA taking a break as we started clearing up to Xegony.&nbsp; When I had got back I had a bunch tells asking why you guys were training us at the zone in.<br /><br />You also forgot to mention you had people bound up on Xegony Isle to setup your SC team.&nbsp; Something no one else could do anymore.&nbsp; Hell, Honch even sent me some fucked up tell about making our lives miserable if we got your bind points taken away up there.<br /><br />&quot;Then we waited for ages for them to clear their way to Xeg island&quot;<br /><br />The GM said we had 6 hours, then Del or Honch(don&#039;t remember which) whined to the GM, so I told him I&#039;m sure we could do it in 3-4hours, and we didn&#039;t even take that long.<br /><br />&quot;then to gather for an attempt, and then to lose.&quot;<br /><br />Boy lets compare, DA/EiE&#039;s first attempt at Xegony ever, and we lose.<br /><br />Ascent&#039;s 5+ (might have been 10+) kill of Xegony, and they wiped twice.&nbsp; Not something I&#039;d really brag about.<br /><br />I will go with Sazz though that the training thing was the first time I&#039;d ever seen that kind of behavior from Ascent members.&nbsp; And I&#039;m sorry but after months of access in that zone, the &quot;we didn&#039;t know they pathed like that&quot; arguement just don&#039;t fly ;)<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11597"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 97<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11597#msg11597"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11597#msg11597">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> October 06, 2004, 08:30:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11594#msg11594">Quote from: Shrek on October 05, 2004, 09:11:35 pm</a></div><div class="quote">You also forgot to mention you had people bound up on Xegony Isle to setup your SC team.  Something no one else could do anymore.  Hell, Honch even sent me some fucked up tell about making our lives miserable if we got your bind points taken away up there.</div>We would have just camped someones necro twink there had the bindpoints been removed, so Honch was overreacting. I&#039;m sure the members I talked to most from your alliance (would probably be Thecklos and Phad) could say that I wouldn&#039;t say such things. Good organization makes for good racing though, so I don&#039;t see anything in us having a necro there except the bonus of boldly going where no rodcet char had gone before!<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">The GM said we had 6 hours, then Del or Honch(don&#039;t remember which) whined to the GM, so I told him I&#039;m sure we could do it in 3-4hours, and we didn&#039;t even take that long.</div>That was me. It was like midnight in Finland and I wouldn&#039;t have stayed up for 6 hours to wait. Not to mention were you very efficient you could have gotten the attempt in like 90min, and I assumed the likely time would be 2-3 hours. Giving you 6 to do it would just tempt you to wait it out to try to get Ascent euros to log out, which would severely diminish our chances of killing Xegony in case you failed.<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">&quot;then to gather for an attempt, and then to lose.&quot;<br />Boy lets compare, DA/EiE&#039;s first attempt at Xegony ever, and we lose.<br />Ascent&#039;s 5+ (might have been 10+) kill of Xegony, and they wiped twice.  Not something I&#039;d really brag about.</div>I think the first one was just a brash pull or whatever. I don&#039;t remember the reasons. Brag or not, we knew we&#039;d win before you would given round robin attempts with equal time for setting up. <br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I will go with Sazz though that the training thing was the first time I&#039;d ever seen that kind of behavior from Ascent members.  And I&#039;m sorry but after months of access in that zone, the &quot;we didn&#039;t know they pathed like that&quot; arguement just don&#039;t fly ;)</div>The training wasn&#039;t intentional, certainly not en masse (sorta hard to vouch for individuals). Obviously everyone from Ascent had to die and I told them to do it asap. This meant we didn&#039;t do it en masse but rather as people came around and some logged in from irc etc. I doubt the first bunch really disturbed you that much, but the people that were afk for like 20min after the thing we killed previously coming back (and zoning in + training without bothering to mention anything due to trying to hide them having afk:d...) usually managed to train pretty much everyone. I think our naked people waiting for SC got trained a bunch of times as well. <br /><br />As I recall it you weren&#039;t at zone-in when we started training, or some of you weren&#039;t anyway. Guess some people training off the first island (as everyone had always been told to do, since training on the first island risked training ZI where naked people were) switched off their brains and went in to the &quot;lolz lets see how far I can get!!&quot; mode, which isn&#039;t exactly smart in a linear zone with another guild there.<br /><br />Had someone intentionally trained, they would have been in a world of shit had they been caught. We were beating you legit (if via a bit unfair advantage), so why spoil your reputation by training?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: October 06, 2004, 08:33:25 am by Delheru</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11612"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317" title="View the profile of Vanden RN">Vanden RN</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 172<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11612#msg11612"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1146.msg11612#msg11612">Re: EQ the Game - and how history played out</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #39 on:</b> October 07, 2004, 03:47:47 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Oh goodness, <br /><br />It&#039;s a tie, you both win <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
